OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrests over death of man
OL,4,Ain street brawl
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man died and a woman was injured in a
OL,7,Flate-night fight that police say
OL,8,Finvolved "a number of people".
OL,10,FIt happened on Drysdale Crescent in the
OL,11,FBrunswick Village area of Newcastle
OL,12,Fsometime before 23:00 BST on Wednesday
OL,13,Fand left a man aged in his 50s dead at
OL,14,Fthe scene while a woman, also in her
OL,15,F50s, required hospital treatment.
OL,17,FA man aged 43 and a woman aged 40 have
OL,18,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of murder.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
