OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrests over death of man
OL,4,Ain street brawl
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthumbria Police Det Insp Barry
OL,7,FMcAtominey said: "Although our
OL,8,Finvestigation is at an early stage, we
OL,9,Fdo believe that those involved were
OL,10,Fknown to each other."
